{
  "story_steps": [
    {
      "step_id": "step_doctor_intro_001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_doctor_brook",
      "text": "You shouldn't be here.",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_doctor_intro_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_doctor_intro_002",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "The doctor glances toward the window.",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_doctor_intro_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_doctor_intro_003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_doctor_brook",
      "text": "Leave before someone sees you.",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "终于……快到了。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_intro_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_002",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "这里应该就是地图上最后有官方标记的车站，后面的路恐怕只能步行了。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_intro_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "就算是想拖欠薪水也没必要躲这么远吧？我这位老雇主还真是富有冒险精神。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_intro_004",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_004",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "看样子太阳快落山了，事不宜迟，还是先抵达镇上安顿为好。再看看地图吧。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_give_map_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_choice_001",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 你准备走哪一条路？(3 options)",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "choice_id": "test_left",
            "text": "向左走（死路，测试返回重选）",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_wrong_001"
          },
          {
            "choice_id": "test_middle",
            "text": "向中间走（进入条件隐藏测试）",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_choice_002"
          },
          {
            "choice_id": "test_right",
            "text": "向右走（进入 4 选项测试）",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_right_001"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_wrong_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 这是一条死路，你退了回来，重新看看该走哪条路。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_test_choice_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_choice_002",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 前面似乎有一扇锁住的门。(2 options, one condition-hidden)",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "choice_id": "test_hidden_a",
            "text": "用测试钥匙开门（应被隐藏，未拥有 item_test_key）",
            "condition": {
              "type": "has_item",
              "id": "item_test_key"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_hidden_a_001"
          },
          {
            "choice_id": "test_visible_b",
            "text": "绕过去继续走",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_end_001"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_hidden_a_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 你用钥匙打开了门。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_test_end_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_right_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 你走向右边的小路。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_test_choice_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_choice_003",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 岔路口有四个方向。(4 options)",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "choices": [
          {
            "choice_id": "test_opt_a",
            "text": "方向 A",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_end_001"
          },
          {
            "choice_id": "test_opt_b",
            "text": "方向 B",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_end_001"
          },
          {
            "choice_id": "test_opt_c",
            "text": "方向 C",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_end_001"
          },
          {
            "choice_id": "test_opt_d",
            "text": "方向 D",
            "condition": {
              "type": "always"
            },
            "next_step": "step_test_end_001"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_end_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 测试链结束。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_give_letter_001",
      "type": "give_item",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "item_id": "item_letter"
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_give_map_001",
      "type": "give_item",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "item_id": "item_map"
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_map_review_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "你开始翻来覆去地研究这张纸，约两分钟后，你终于不得不接受它已经在充分发挥过其作用后行至功成身退的时刻——",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_map_review_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_map_review_002",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "尼舍镇所在的位置只有一片密林，或许它的规模还不足以登上一张北郡地图。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_map_review_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_map_review_003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "那么就只能想想别的法子找路了……对了，我记得信里似乎提到过。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_give_letter_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_letter_review_001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "（耸肩）……“语焉不详的目的地线索”，是指这些意味不明的涂鸦吗？",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_letter_review_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_letter_review_002",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "这算是考核？好吧，真是位拧巴的委托人。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_letter_review_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_letter_review_003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "前面似乎有条小路，先过去看看吧。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_change_view_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "你走出车站，沿着杂草丛生的小径一路向前，不多时，便抵达了一处三岔路口。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_002",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "漆黑的林木立在两旁，仿佛某些上古神话里拱卫地狱之门的狠角色，过高的尺寸带来无言的压迫感。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_003",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "这里的树木似乎高耸异常。除此之外，你左右环顾，三条岔路看上去没什么不同。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_004",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_004",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "一根破旧的牌柱。不知已在此伫立多久，三个路牌歪歪扭扭地挂在上面，漆皮脱落后裸露出某种灰白底色，喑哑且斑驳地盘踞。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_depart_change_view_001",
      "type": "change_view",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {
        "view_id": "view_forest_fork"
      },
      "next_step": "step_station_depart_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_fork_inspect_top_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "一块看上去有些年头的木板，上面歪歪扭扭地刻着1.5km。",
      "condition": {
        "type": "always"
      },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_fork_inspect_top_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
